<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="scroll-smooth" lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" name="viewport"/>
  <meta content="Orientación psicológica puntual en sesión única. Una conversación profesional para entender mejor lo que te está pasando, ordenar la situación y pensar cómo abordarla." name="description"/>
  <title>Primera Pausa — Orientación Psicológica Puntual</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
  <link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600;1,700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    :root {
      /* Tokens de arquitectura estilo Carbon adaptados a Editorial Serenity */
      --cds-background: #fcf9f3;
      --cds-background-inverse: #4a0002;
      --cds-layer-01: #f6f3ed;
      --cds-layer-02: #ffffff;
      --cds-interactive-01: #4a0002;
      --cds-interactive-02: #d9531e;
      --cds-focus: #e06d3b;
    }

    @layer base {
      html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { overscroll-behavior: none; }
      .pb-safe { padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px); }
      .pt-safe { padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); }
    }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

    /* Animaciones de entrada sutiles */
    .reveal-init {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(22px);
      transition: opacity 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.85s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      will-change: opacity, transform;
    }
    .reveal-visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* Resplandor ambiental */
    @keyframes subtlePulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.18; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(1.08); }
    }
    .animate-ambient-glow {
      animation: subtlePulse 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    /* Murmullos de fondo en el Hero */
    .chatter-voice {
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      opacity: 0.14;
      user-select: none;
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
    }
    .chatter-voice:hover {
      opacity: 0.38;
    }

    /* Control deslizante del Medidor de Peso Emocional */
    input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      appearance: none;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e06d3b;
      border: 3px solid #ffdad5;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
      transform: scale(1.15);
    }
    input[type="range"]::-moz-range-thumb {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e06d3b;
      border: 3px solid #ffdad5;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    /* Destello de foco en tarjetas de precios al recomendar desde el Medidor */
    @keyframes targetFlash {
      0% { transform: scale(1); outline: 2px solid transparent; }
      35% { transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02); outline: 3px solid #e06d3b; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(107,0,3,0.28); }
      100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); outline: 2px solid transparent; }
    }
    .card-target-highlight {
      animation: targetFlash 1.4s ease-out;
    }
  </style>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
  <script id="tailwind-config">
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: "class",
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            "primary": "#4a0002",
            "primary-dark": "#360002",
            "primary-deep": "#2d0001",
            "primary-container": "#6b0003",
            "on-primary": "#ffffff",
            "terracota": "#d9531e",
            "terracota-light": "#e06d3b",
            "terracota-warm": "#c85a32",
            "surface": "#fcf9f3",
            "surface-dim": "#f5f0e6",
            "surface-container-low": "#f6f3ed",
            "surface-container": "#f0eee8",
            "surface-container-high": "#ebe8e2",
            "surface-container-lowest": "#ffffff",
            "on-surface": "#1c1c18",
            "on-surface-variant": "#58413e",
            "secondary-container": "#ffc7bf",
            "secondary-fixed": "#ffdad5",
            "secondary-fixed-dim": "#f0bab1",
            "outline": "#8c716d",
            "outline-variant": "#e0bfbb",
            "surface-tint": "#ab3329",
            "error": "#ba1a1a"
          },
          fontFamily: {
            "serif": ["Playfair Display", "serif"],
            "sans": ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"],
            "display-lg": ["Playfair Display", "serif"],
            "headline-lg": ["Playfair Display", "serif"],
            "headline-md": ["Playfair Display", "serif"],
            "headline-sm": ["Playfair Display", "serif"],
            "body-lg": ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"],
            "body-md": ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"],
            "body-sm": ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"],
            "label-md": ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"],
            "label-sm": ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"]
          },
          borderRadius: {
            "DEFAULT": "1rem",
            "lg": "1.75rem",
            "xl": "2.5rem",
            "full": "9999px"
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-surface font-sans text-on-surface antialiased selection:bg-terracota selection:text-white pb-20 lg:pb-0">

<!-- ==================== HEADER STICKY (Desktop + Menú Mobile) ==================== -->
<header class="sticky top-0 left-0 w-full z-40 bg-[#fbf8f2]/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-[#ebdcd8]/60 transition-all duration-300 pt-safe">
  <div class="h-16 lg:h-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <!-- Isotipo '|| Primera Pausa' -->
    <a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 shrink-0 group" href="#">
      <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold tracking-tighter text-xs shadow-sm group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200">
        <span class="inline-block tracking-[-2px] text-sm font-black">||</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <span class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary leading-none">Primera Pausa</span>
        <span class="lg:hidden text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant font-semibold mt-0.5">Orientación Puntual</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Navegación Desktop -->
    <nav aria-label="Navegación principal" class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-8 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#4f3b39]">
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#situaciones">Situaciones</a>
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#que-trabajamos">Qué trabajamos</a>
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a>
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#termometro">Medidor</a>
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#modalidades">Modalidades</a>
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#quienes-somos">Quiénes somos</a>
      <a class="hover:text-terracota transition-colors duration-200" href="#preguntas">Preguntas</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Acciones Derecha -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0">
      <button type="button" onclick="openPausaModal()" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#4a0002] text-white text-xs sm:text-[14px] font-semibold px-4 sm:px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-terracota transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(74,0,2,0.18)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[17px] sm:text-[18px]">chat</span>
        <span>Necesito hablar</span>
      </button>
      <!-- Botón Menú Hamburguesa Mobile -->
      <button type="button" id="mobile-menu-btn" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav-drawer" aria-label="Abrir menú de navegación" class="lg:hidden w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-surface-container text-primary flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-secondary-container/50 transition-colors">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]" id="mobile-menu-icon">menu</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Menú Desplegable Mobile -->
  <div id="mobile-nav-drawer" class="hidden lg:hidden bg-[#fbf8f2] border-b border-[#ebdcd8] px-6 py-5 flex-col gap-3 shadow-lg">
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border-b border-surface-container flex items-center justify-between" href="#situaciones">
      <span>Situaciones frecuentes</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border-b border-surface-container flex items-center justify-between" href="#que-trabajamos">
      <span>¿Qué podemos trabajar?</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border-b border-surface-container flex items-center justify-between" href="#como-funciona">
      <span>Cómo funciona</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border-b border-surface-container flex items-center justify-between" href="#termometro">
      <span>Medidor de Peso Emocional</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border-b border-surface-container flex items-center justify-between" href="#modalidades">
      <span>Modalidades y Tarifas</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary border-b border-surface-container flex items-center justify-between" href="#quienes-somos">
      <span>Equipo Profesional</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
    <a onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary flex items-center justify-between" href="#preguntas">
      <span>Preguntas Frecuentes</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-terracota">chevron_right</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="w-full">
  <!-- ==================== 1. HERO SECTION ==================== -->
  <section class="relative w-full bg-[#4a0002] text-white overflow-hidden py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24 border-b border-[#631014]">
    <!-- Resplandor ambiental -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 -left-40 w-[500px] sm:w-[600px] h-[500px] sm:h-[600px] rounded-full bg-[#7a060a] blur-[120px] animate-ambient-glow -z-0"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[400px] sm:w-[500px] h-[400px] sm:h-[500px] rounded-full bg-[#360002] blur-[100px] -z-0"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8 items-center">
        <!-- Columna Izquierda: Titular de impacto editorial -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start gap-5 sm:gap-6 reveal-init">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#360002]/90 border border-[#78181e] text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#ffdad5] font-semibold">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracota-light"></span>
            ORIENTACIÓN PSICOLÓGICA PUNTUAL
          </div>

          <div class="relative">
            <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-2 leading-[1.05]">
              NECESITÁS
              <span class="block italic font-normal text-terracota-light text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl -mt-1 lg:-mt-2">
                hablar.
              </span>
            </h1>
            <div class="inline-block mt-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-terracota text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide shadow-md">
              No necesariamente hacer terapia.
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-[#ffdad5]/95 max-w-xl leading-relaxed pt-1">
            Una conversación profesional para entender mejor lo que te está pasando, ordenar la situación y pensar cómo abordarla.
          </p>

          <!-- Botones duales del Hero -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3.5 sm:gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto pt-2">
            <button type="button" onclick="openPausaModal()" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#fdfbf7] text-[#4a0002] font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] hover:bg-[#ffdad5] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]">chat_bubble</span>
              <span>Necesito hablar</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" onclick="openPausaModal('Pausa Prioritaria (<24hs - $95.000 ARS)')" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#2d0001] text-white border border-[#852327] font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full hover:bg-terracota hover:border-terracota hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px] text-[#ffdad5]">bolt</span>
              <span>Necesito hablar hoy</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Microcopia ética con contraste mejorado WCAG AA -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-xs text-[#ffdad5]/85">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-terracota-light shrink-0">info</span>
            <span>Turnos sujetos a disponibilidad. No es un servicio de emergencia ni guardia médica.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Columna Derecha: Clima visual con las voces que abruman vs la pregunta esencial -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex items-center justify-center min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[360px] lg:min-h-[440px] reveal-init" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
          <div class="relative w-full h-full p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#3a0002]/60 border border-[#6b151a] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center items-center shadow-inner">
            <!-- Voces de fondo -->
            <div class="chatter-voice absolute top-5 left-5 text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-base">“YO EN TU LUGAR...”</div>
            <div class="chatter-voice absolute top-12 right-5 text-[11px] sm:text-xs lg:text-sm">“TENÉS QUE DEJARLO”</div>
            <div class="chatter-voice absolute top-24 left-4 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">“NO ES PARA TANTO”</div>
            <div class="chatter-voice absolute bottom-20 right-4 text-[11px] sm:text-xs lg:text-sm">“NO LE DES TANTAS VUELTAS”</div>
            <div class="chatter-voice absolute bottom-10 left-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">“DEBERÍAS HABLARLO”</div>
            <div class="chatter-voice absolute bottom-5 right-8 text-[11px] sm:text-xs">“PENSÁ EN VOS”</div>
            <div class="chatter-voice hidden sm:block absolute top-32 right-8 text-xs">“YA VA A PASAR...”</div>

            <!-- Centro tipográfico destacado -->
            <div class="relative z-10 text-center px-5 py-7 sm:px-6 sm:py-8 max-w-sm rounded-xl bg-[#4a0002]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#ffdad5]/20 shadow-xl">
              <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#ffdad5]/85 font-semibold block mb-2">
                ENTRE TANTAS VOCES
              </span>
              <h2 class="font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#ffc7bf] font-medium leading-tight">
                ¿qué necesitás vos?
              </h2>
              <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-terracota mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 2. SECCIÓN: SITUACIONES ==================== -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[#3d0002] text-white py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-28 relative overflow-hidden" id="situaciones">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-14">
      <!-- Encabezado reflexivo -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl reveal-init">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#ffdad5] leading-snug font-normal">
          Hay situaciones que no necesitan un tratamiento largo, sino una <span class="italic text-terracota-light">conversación a tiempo</span> con alguien que sabe escuchar y ordenar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Las 3 tarjetas de problemáticas categorizadas con números '01', '02', '03' -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        <!-- Tarjeta 1: VÍNCULOS -->
        <div onclick="openPausaModalWithArea('Vínculos / Pareja')" class="cursor-pointer relative bg-[#4e0205] rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-[#78181e] flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[240px] shadow-lg overflow-hidden group hover:border-terracota hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 reveal-init">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-2 font-serif text-[110px] font-bold text-white/5 select-none pointer-events-none group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors">
            01
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-terracota text-[22px]">favorite</span>
              <h3 class="text-terracota font-bold tracking-wider text-base lg:text-lg uppercase">
                VÍNCULOS
              </h3>
              <div class="flex-1 h-[1px] bg-terracota/40"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white pt-1 leading-relaxed">
              “Discutí con mi pareja y no sé qué hacer.”
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#ffdad5]/85">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-terracota shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <span>Desarmar la escalada y clarificar límites saludables</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tarjeta 2: DECISIONES -->
        <div onclick="openPausaModalWithArea('Toma de decisiones')" class="cursor-pointer relative bg-[#4e0205] rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-[#78181e] flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[240px] shadow-lg overflow-hidden group hover:border-terracota hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 reveal-init" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-2 font-serif text-[110px] font-bold text-white/5 select-none pointer-events-none group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors">
            02
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-terracota text-[22px]">alt_route</span>
              <h3 class="text-terracota font-bold tracking-wider text-base lg:text-lg uppercase">
                DECISIONES
              </h3>
              <div class="flex-1 h-[1px] bg-terracota/40"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white pt-1 leading-relaxed">
              “Tengo que tomar una decisión importante y estoy trabadísima.”
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#ffdad5]/85">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-terracota shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <span>Mitigar la parálisis y ordenar alternativas posibles</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tarjeta 3: TRABAJO -->
        <div onclick="openPausaModalWithArea('Trabajo / Rumia laboral')" class="cursor-pointer relative bg-[#4e0205] rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-8 border border-[#78181e] flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[240px] shadow-lg overflow-hidden group hover:border-terracota hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 reveal-init" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-2 font-serif text-[110px] font-bold text-white/5 select-none pointer-events-none group-hover:text-white/10 transition-colors">
            03
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-terracota text-[22px]">work</span>
              <h3 class="text-terracota font-bold tracking-wider text-base lg:text-lg uppercase">
                TRABAJO
              </h3>
              <div class="flex-1 h-[1px] bg-terracota/40"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white pt-1 leading-relaxed">
              “Pasó algo en el trabajo y no puedo dejar de pensarlo.”
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#ffdad5]/85">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-terracota shrink-0">check_circle</span>
            <span>Despejar la rumia y recuperar serenidad operativa</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Módulo Inferior: Lista de situaciones orientativas -->
      <div class="bg-[#2c0002]/75 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-12 border border-[#6b151a] flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start justify-between reveal-init">
        <div class="max-w-md flex flex-col gap-2.5">
          <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-white leading-tight">
            ¿En qué situaciones podemos orientarte?
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#ffdad5]/85">
            Algunos ejemplos de lo que suele traer a una Primera Pausa:
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#ffdad5]">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-terracota font-bold text-lg select-none leading-snug">→</span>
